 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508087,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Solve the inequality <span data-math=\"8p + 3(p - 12) \\geq 7p - 28\">8p + 3(p - 12) \\geq 7p - 28</span>, graph the solution on the number line, and write the solution in interval notation.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"8p + 3\\left( {p - 12} \\right) \\ge 7p - 28\"></span></p>\n<p>First solve the inequality.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"8p + 3\\left( {p - 12} \\right) \\ge 7p - 28\"></span></td>\n<td>Distribute.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"8p + 3p - 36 \\ge 7p - 28\"></span></td>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"11p - 36 \\ge 7p - 28\"></span>.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"11p - 36 - 7p \\ge 7p - 28 - 7p\"></span></td>\n<td>Collect variable terms on the left.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"4p - 36 \\ge  - 28\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"4p - 36 + 36 \\ge  - 28 + 36\"></span></td>\n<td>Collect constants on the right.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"4p \\ge 8\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{4p}}{4} \\ge \\frac{8}{4}\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide by 4.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"p \\ge 2\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>For the graph, place a bracket at 2 to show that the solution includes 2. Shade to the right of <span data-math=\"2\"></span> to show all numbers right of <span data-math=\"2\"></span> are included.</p>\n<p>Write in interval notation with a bracket at 2 to show that 2 is included. Then shade to the right to show that all numbers greater than 2 are part of the solution.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "&nbsp;<br>\n<span data-math=\"p \\geq 2\">p \\geq 2</span>\n<img src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBc0VPIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--b11af60ec51024748f7be6273c021581418c8a54/CS_Figure_05_03_014.png\" alt=\"A number line ranges from 0 to 3, in increments of 1. An open square bracket is marked at 2. The region to the right of the square bracket is shaded on the number line. Text reads, (2, infinity).\">"
    }
   ],
